      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A beast wreathed in lightning and specializes in thunder attacks. It represents a younger version of a kuza beast.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 22, touch 9; flat-footed 22 (+13 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 126 [180] (12d10+60)</p><p>Fort +12, Ref +10, Will +5</p><p>Resist Lightning 5, Water 50%</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +18 (1d6+7), Gore +19 (1d8+7)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Electric Shock, Impale</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 24, Dex 10, Con 18, Int 6, Wis 12, Cha 8</p><p>Base Atk +12; CMB +20; CMD 30</p><p>Feats Improved Overrun, Lightning Reflexes, Multiattack, Power Attack, Toughness, Weapon Focus (Gore)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +11, Climb +15, Perception +13, Survival +10</p>"
